    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48105" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thēbē</span></b> ,
			ēs,f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a female name.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A nymph</i>, <i>daughter of the
				river-god Asopus</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. Am. 3, 6,
			33</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Wife of the tyrant Alexander of
			Pheræ</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Inv. 2, 49, 144</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Off. 2,
				7, 25</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
